0:12.960">on </span><span begin="00:12.960" end="00:13.590">hold</span><span begin="00:13.590" end="00:13.770">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.770" end="00:18.750"><span begin="00:13.770" end="00:14.250">There's </span><span begin="00:14.250" end="00:14.400">all </span><span begin="00:14.400" end="00:14.850">sorts </span><span begin="00:14.850" end="00:14.940">of </span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:16.020">shapes</span><span begin="00:16.020" end="00:16.260">, </span><span begin="00:16.260" end="00:16.530">that </span><span begin="00:16.530" end="00:16.650">I </span><span begin="00:16.650" end="00:17.010">bet </span><span begin="00:17.010" end="00:17.190">you </span><span begin="00:17.190" end="00:17.460">can </span><span begin="00:17.460" end="00:18.480">make</span><span begin="00:18.480" end="00:18.610">.</span><span begin="00:18.610" end="00:18.750">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.750" end="00:22.230"><span begin="00:18.750" end="00:19.050">When </span><span begin="00:19.050" end="00:19.200">you </span><span begin="00:19.200" end="00:19.440">want </span><span begin="00:19.440" end="00:19.680">to </span><span begin="00:19.680" end="00:20.730">escape </span><span begin="00:20.730" end="00:21.330">say </span><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:21.480">the </span><span begin="00:21.480" end="00:22.230">word</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.320" end="00:26.010"><span begin="00:22.320" end="00:22.560">Well </span><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:22.650">I </span><span begin="00:22.650" end="00:23.130">know </span><span begin="00:23.130" end="00:23.280">that </span><span begin="00:23.280" end="00:23.640">getting </span><span begin="00:23.640" end="00:23.820">you </span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:24.480">alone </span><span begin="00:24.480" end="00:24.750">isn't </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.050">easy </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.170">to </span><span begin="00:25.170" end="00:26.010">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.030" end="00:31.110"><span begin="00:27.030" end="00:27.390">With </span><span begin="00:27.390" end="00:27.540">the </span><span begin="00:27.540" end="00:28.410">exception </span><span begin="00:28.410" end="00:28.500">of </span><span begin="00:28.500" end="00:28.680">you </span><span begin="00:28.680" end="00:28.770">I </span><span begin="00:28.770" end="00:29.490">dislike </span><span begin="00:29.490" end="00:29.970">everyone </span><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.090">in </span><span begin="00:30.090" end="00:30.210">the </span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:31.110">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.400" end="00:35.760"><span begin="00:32.400" end="00:32.640">And </span><span begin="00:32.640" end="00:32.730">I </span><span begin="00:32.730" end="00:33.180">don't </span><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.510">wanna </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:33.780">lie</span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:33.780">, </span><span begin="00:33.780" end="00:33.900">but </span><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:33.990">I </span><span begin="00:33.990" end="00:34.440">don't </span><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.770">wanna </span><span begin="00:34.770" end="00:35.010">tell </span><span begin="00:35.010" end="00:35.130">you </span><span begin="00:35.130" end="00:35.250">the </span><span begin="00:35.250" end="00:35.760">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.760" end="00:37.710"><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:35.940">Get </span><span begin="00:35.940" end="00:36.060">the </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.450">sense </span><span begin="00:36.450" end="00:36.600">that </span><span begin="00:36.600" end="00:36.810">you're </span><span begin="00:36.810" end="00:37.050">on </span><span begin="00:37.050" end="00:37.170">the </span><span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.710">move</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.710" end="00:41.190"><span begin="00:37.710" end="00:37.830">And </span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:37.950">you'll </span><span begin="00:37.950" end="00:38.430">probably </span><span begin="00:38.430" end="00:38.550">be </span><span begin="00:38.550" end="00:39.000">leaving </span><span begin="00:39.000" end="00:39.510">soon</span><span begin="00:39.510" end="00:39.540">, </span><span begin="00:39.540" end="00:39.750">so </span><span begin="00:39.750" end="00:39.870">I'm </span><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:40.380">telling </span><span begin="00:40.380" end="00:41.190">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.380" end="00:53.400"><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.950">Stop </span><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.100">the </span><span begin="00:44.100" end="00:44.730">world </span><span begin="00:44.730" end="00:44.970">cause </span><span begin="00:44.970" end="00:45.090">I </span><span begin="00:45.090" end="00:46.290">wanna</span><span begin="00:46.290" end="00:48.630">, </span><span begin="00:48.630" end="00:49.110">get </span><span begin="00:49.110" end="00:50.730">off</span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:51.030">, </span><span begin="00:51.030" end="00:51.570">with </span><span begin="00:51.570" end="00:53.400">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.490" end="01:14.610"><span begin="00:53.490" end="00:54.090">Stop </span><span begin="00:54.090" end="00:54.270">the </span><span begin="00:54.270" end="00:54.840">world </span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.080">cause </span><span begin="00:55.080" end="00:55.200">I </span><span begin="00:55.200" end="00:56.400">wanna</span><span begin="00:56.400" end="00:58.740">, </span><span begin="00:58.740" end="00:59.250">get </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="01:01.080">off</span><span begin="01:01.080" end="01:01.110">, </span><span begin="01:01.110" end="01:01.680">with </span><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:03.900">you</span><span begin="01:03.900" end="01:14.610">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.610" end="01:19.440"><span begin="01:14.610" end="01:14.970">Eyes </span><span begin="01:14.970" end="01: